{
  "id": "word-wrap",
  "title": "贪心自动换行算法",
  "shortTitle": "自动换行",
  "kind": "algorithm",
  "difficulty": "medium",
  "prompt": "请在 src/wrap.mjs 中实现 `wrapText(text, width)` 函数，按以下规则将文本切分为多行并以数组返回：\n\n1. 先将 text 按空白字符分割为单词列表（连续空格视为一个分隔符，首尾空白忽略）。\n2. 贪心地将单词逐个拼入当前行；单词之间用单个空格隔开。\n3. 若加入下一个单词后当前行长度超过 width，则另起新行。\n4. 若某个单词本身长度已超过 width，该单词单独占一行。\n5. 返回字符串数组，每个元素是一行（不含行尾空格或换行符）；空字符串输入返回空数组。\n\n只允许修改 src/wrap.mjs。",
  "allowedFiles": ["src/wrap.mjs"],
  "verify": {
    "cmd": "node verify/verify.mjs",
    "rootCauseRegex": "贪心|greedy|超过|overflow|width|长度|space|空格"
  },
  "timeoutSeconds": 300,
  "weights": {
    "tests": 30,
    "firstPass": 20,
    "scopeControl": 20,
    "instructionFollowing": 15,
    "rootCause": 10,
    "pathEfficiency": 5
  },
  "speedTargets": {
    "targetFirstActionSeconds": 20,
    "maxFirstActionSeconds": 90,
    "targetDurationSeconds": 120,
    "maxDurationSeconds": 420,
    "targetCommandWaitSeconds": 4,
    "maxCommandWaitSeconds": 40,
    "targetOutputTokensPerSecond": 18,
    "floorOutputTokensPerSecond": 6
  }
}
